# Subgraph workspace. All three are regenerated:
#   node_modules/  -> npm install (484 packages)
#   generated/     -> npx graph codegen
#   build/         -> npx graph build
# These paths are NOT covered by the root-anchored /node_modules and /build
# rules above, so without these lines `git add` would sweep in the whole
# subgraph dependency tree.
/subgraph/node_modules/
/subgraph/build/

